	(text "Photodiode in photovoltaic mode (0 V bias):\nPD_A -> op-amp IN-, PD_K -> GNDA, IN+ -> GNDA.\nRf from OUT to IN-, Cf across Rf.\n\nVout = Isc x Rf.  Pick Rf so full sun (~1000 W/m2)\ngives ~2.5 V: Rf = 2.5 V / Isc_fullsun.\nMEASURE Isc_fullsun first (meter in uA/mA mode,\nPD shorted, in real sun, behind the window).\nCf: fc = 1/(2 pi Rf Cf) ~ 100 Hz (CAN rate 10 Hz).\n\nOp-amp: rail-to-rail out, low offset, can source\na few mA (e.g. TLV9001 / TLV9002 from parts list).\nSupply from VDDA, ground to GNDA.\nOutput must stay below VDDA: check headroom."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 26.669999999999998 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "971aa2dd-efdf-49c3-986e-3b4c6dab3bfc")
	)
