	(text "IRRAD_TEST (MCU GPIO) -> R_test -> op-amp IN-.\nWith PD dark/covered: Vout = (3.3 V / R_test) x Rf.\ne.g. R_test = 1M -> 3.3 uA known current.\nProves the TIA + ADC chain works (validity bit).\nLeave GPIO Hi-Z in normal operation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 146.05 83.82 0)
